[en.DECISION_C15_C15_RE_ELECTION]
Immediate Re-election

[en.DECISION_C15_C15_RE_ELECTION_desc]
Flurry Heart demands an immediate re-election of the Crystal Empire Council on the pretext of bribery in the recent election.

[zh.DECISION_C15_C15_RE_ELECTION]
立即重新选举

[zh.DECISION_C15_C15_RE_ELECTION_desc]
风雪之心以最近的选举中存在贿选行为为借口，要求立即重新选举水晶帝国理事会。
